### 🟡 IMPLEMENT IMMEDIATELY — Non-Negotiable Missing Features

| Feature | Why It's Critical |
|---|---|
| **User display name** | The welcome banner says `WELCOME BACK, STUDENT` (shows `user.role`, not a name). The [User](file:///c:/Users/chatz/Downloads/AST/ast4-lesson-builder/context/auth-context.tsx#8-13) type only has `user_id`, `role`, `email`. There's no `fullName` field exposed from the JWT or API despite [signup()](file:///c:/Users/chatz/Downloads/AST/ast4-lesson-builder/context/auth-context.tsx#69-84) accepting one. **Fix: decode/store `fullName` and display it.** |
| **Settings "Save" is fake** | The settings form has an onChange for the name field but the "Synchronize Profile" button has **no onClick handler** — it literally cannot save. Needs a real API call to update profile. |
| **Password change "Modify" link** | Shows a "Modify" link next to the password field but it's a dead `<Button variant="link">` with no handler. Either implement or remove. |
| **Notification settings cards** (Alerts, Interface) | Two cards on the settings page with no click behavior. They show fake data ("6 System Directives", "High Contrast Terminal"). Remove or implement real preferences. |
| **"2FA Initialized" badge in settings** | Shows as if 2FA is active, but no 2FA system exists. Remove this badge. |
| **Progress page is 100% fake data** | Every single value is hardcoded: skill radar data, XP bars, achievement badges (4/6 "unlocked"), streak "7 CONSECUTIVE DAYS", timeline milestones. None of this comes from any API. |

