## 2. UI Overhaul — Making This Student/Learning-Ready

### Problem: Military Command-Center Aesthetic

The entire dashboard uses alienating, sci-fi/military language that makes **zero sense for a learning platform**. Students don't operate "terminals" or execute "directives."

### Terminology Purge — What Must Change

| Current (Military) | Replace With (Learning) |
|---|---|
| "MISSION CONTROL ACTIVE" | "Welcome back!" |
| "AGENT" / "Operator" | Student name or "Learner" |
| "Sector", "Sector-9", "Delta-4" | Remove entirely |
| "Deployment" / "Deploy" / "Initialize Deployment" | "Enroll" / "Start Course" |
| "Directive" / "Secure Directive" | "Lesson" / "Activity" |
| "Synchronizing Terminal" | "Loading your courses..." |
| "TERMINATE" (unregister) | "Leave Course" / "Unenroll" |
| "LAUNCH DIRECTIVE" | "Start Lesson" / "Continue" |
| "REVISIT TERMINAL" | "Review Lesson" |
| "Sector Clearance" | "Your Progress" |
| "Deployment Recommendation Required" | "No courses yet" |
| "INITIALIZE NEW DEPLOYMENT" | "Browse Courses" |
| "Emerald Hub", "Directive 4.0" | "After-School Academy" (your actual brand) |
| "Director Clearance Granted" | "Teacher Dashboard" |
| "Agent Oversight" | "My Students" |
| "Command Center" | "Dashboard" |
| "Protocol Settings" | "Settings" |
| "Deployment Hub" | "My Courses" |
| "CORE SYNCING..." | "Enrolling..." |
| "Sync Progress" | "Progress" |
| "Identity Timeline" | "Activity History" |
| "Cognitive Profile" | "Skills Breakdown" |
| "Re-initialize Sync" | "Try Again" |
| "Terminate Session" | "Log Out" |
| "Authenticated" (header) | Show user's actual name |
| "Operator Profile" (dropdown) | "My Account" |

### Visual & Layout Changes Needed

1. **Scanline effect** (`animate-scan` div in layout) — Remove. This is a CRT monitor effect. Students don't use CRT monitors.
2. **Grid overlay** (4px scanline pattern in [dashboard-shell.tsx](file:///c:/Users/chatz/Downloads/AST/ast4-lesson-builder/components/dashboard/dashboard-shell.tsx) and layouts) — Remove. Same reason.
3. **8px–10px ALL-CAPS text everywhere** — Increase to 12–14px mixed-case. Current text is nearly unreadable. Accessibility failure.
4. **Font weight `font-black` on everything** — Tone down. When everything is bold, nothing stands out.
5. **`tracking-widest` / `tracking-[0.3em]` letter-spacing** on body text — Remove or reduce. Makes reading slow and painful.
6. **Header shows `user.role` instead of name** — Fix to show the student's actual name.
7. **Sidebar footer** ("Operator Active", "Sector-9") — Show actual user info (name, email).
8. **Color scheme** is fine (dark + emerald accents) but the `animate-pulse` on the sidebar logo icon is distracting — remove or make it subtle.
9. **Sidebar z-index (60) overlaps header z-index (50)** — The sidebar renders ON TOP of the header. Needs z-index coordination.
10. **Mobile nav has Settings duplicated** — [student-mobile-nav.tsx](file:///c:/Users/chatz/Downloads/AST/ast4-lesson-builder/components/dashboard/sidebar/student-mobile-nav.tsx) renders 4 items in the `navItems` array + a separate 5th `<Link>` for Settings hardcoded below, meaning Settings appears in both.

